## Catalog Governance

| Item | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Implementation state | Use `実装済み`, `策定済み`, or `対象外`. |
| Out of scope | Generic UI, WYSIWYG Editor UI, official icon set, generated CSS and JavaScript. |
| Synchronization | Update `Docs/Master_Spec`, this catalog, `Docs/Document_Index`, `Brand/`, and checks when needed. |
| Change unit | Specification, catalog, asset files, and check updates are reviewed together. |

Samples can demonstrate brand assets, but Samples are not the source of truth.
